        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Phil Rudd\n- Roles: bass guitar\n- Organizations: AC/DC\n- Products: the band's third LP, \"Let's Get It Up\"\n\nFacts:\n- In 1974, the individual who played bass guitar on AC/DC's third LP left the band.\n- After that 1974 departure, Phil Rudd became the only Australian-born member of AC/DC.\n- In 1976, AC/DC's third LP was released in Australia and in Europe.\n- \"Let's Get It Up\" is a song by AC/DC.",
